;;;; Indonesia: the SKB 3 Menteri (Menteri Agama, Menteri Ketenagakerjaan, Menteri
;;;; PAN-RB) tentang Hari Libur Nasional dan Cuti Bersama of each year 2005-2027, with
;;;; every amending SKB and the election-day Keppres, against the fixed and Easter rules
;;;; of indonesia-holidays-calendar. :HOLIDAYS are the hari libur nasional the rules do
;;;; not give (Imlek, Isra Mikraj, Nyepi, Waisak, the Islamic days, election and one-off
;;;; days); :SUPPRESSED are rule dates the SKB did not keep (2008-08-17, moved to the
;;;; 18th); :CUTI are the cuti bersama, collective leave that binds ASN (by Keppres)
;;;; and not private employers, added only by (indonesia-holidays-calendar :cuti-bersama t).
;;;; Texts: jdih.kemnaker.go.id (2014-2027), menkokesra.go.id / kemenag.go.id on
;;;; Wayback (2005-2013), setkab.go.id, kemenkopmk.go.id. 2000-2004: no primary text found.

